BELLONIX ALM (Advanced Logic Masters)
=====================================
RENTAL CASE PRESENTATION: BELLONIX RENT ECOSYSTEM

This is a mock presentation document for testing.
In production, this slides presentation demonstrates the complete workflow for vehicle and equipment rental:
- Step 1: Client books rental on site.
- Step 2: Viber/Telegram Bot alerts the fleet manager.
- Step 3: Dispatcher checks out keys via Bot command.
- Step 4: System updates real-time analytics dashboards tracking rentals, revenues, and fuel logs.

Contact us at office@bellonix.com.ua for case studies.
